#. Description of the plugin
#: qr-attendance.php
msgid "Student attendance and absence tracking. Teachers open a session and project a rotating QR code; students scan it with their phone to check in. Absences, late arrivals and excuses are tracked per course, with reports and CSV export."
msgstr ""

